-- PHB II feat prerequisites.
-- Prerequisite wording is preserved from Tables 3-1 through 3-7.
-- PHB II contains compound requirements (specific proficiencies, skill specializations,
-- class abilities, and "any two other" feat groups) that the generic prerequisite AST
-- cannot always express without dependent catalog IDs. These are stored in the schema's
-- namespaced custom prerequisite extension rather than being silently simplified.

